---
// src/pages/terms.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Cozivara Living"
  description="Terms and conditions for using Cozivara Living website and its published interior decor content."
>
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-cozi-bg">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-cozi-border">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-cozi-charcoal/70 block mb-2">LEGAL TERMS</span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-cozi-charcoal/60 mt-2">Effective Date: April 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-cozi max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Cozivara Living</strong>. By accessing or using this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions. If you disagree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of the site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">1. Intellectual Property & Content Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, Cozivara Living and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all editorial content, photographs, graphics, articles, and design layouts published on <code>cozivaraliving.com</code>. All rights are reserved. You may view and pin images to Pinterest for personal, non-commercial use, subject to restrictions set in these terms.
        </p>
        <p>You must not:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Republish complete articles from Cozivara Living without written attribution and canonical link.</li>
          <li>Sell, rent, or sub-license material from Cozivara Living.</li>
          <li>Scrape or mass-duplicate content using automated software or AI training harvesters without explicit consent.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">2. Pinterest Sharing & Social Pinning</h2>
        <p>
          We encourage readers to share our photography, infographics, and decor guides on Pinterest, Instagram, and social channels. When pinning or sharing, please maintain the original links and visible credit to Cozivara Living.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">3. Disclaimer of DIY & Home Decor Advice</h2>
        <p>
          The information provided on Cozivara Living is for general decorative, aesthetic, and informational purposes only. While our writers strive for accuracy and safety, any DIY installation, painting, furniture restructuring, or home modifications you undertake are done entirely at your own risk.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">4. Affiliate Links & Sponsored Endorsements</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with FTC guidelines, please assume that any links leading to products or retail shops may be affiliate links. We only recommend pieces that align with our brand ethos of quality, durability, and aesthetic serenity.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">5. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding these Terms of Service, please reach out to us at <a href="mailto:cozivaraliving2495@gmail.com" class="text-cozi-olive underline font-medium">cozivaraliving2495@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
